          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each morning, you record your answer with the front camera to stop the alarm.\nTry it once, before your first morning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎朝、インカメラで答えを録画してアラームを止めます。\n最初の朝が来る前に、一度だけ試しておきましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row is a week. Answered mornings remain as dots." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1行が1週間。答えた日が点として残る"
